            <h1 class="auth-brand-name">TripPlanner</h1>
            <p class="auth-brand-tagline">Every great journey begins<br />with a single step</p>
            <div class="auth-feature-pills">
                <span class="auth-pill">🥾 Hiking &amp; Trail Runs</span>
                <span class="auth-pill">🗺️ Trip Planning</span>
                <span class="auth-pill">📍 Wishlists &amp; Places</span>
                <span class="auth-pill">🧭 GPX Tracks</span>
